---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="CogCore"
  description="A writing hub for CogCore architecture, design decisions, and technical essays."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Open-source focus</p>
      <h1>CogCore technical writing hub.</h1>
      <p>
        This page is ready to become the public story for CogCore: what it does,
        why it exists, and how its internals work.
      </p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button" href="https://github.com/carsonDB/cogCore">GitHub Repo</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/blog/">Related Posts</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section">
    <h2>Recommended Blog Series</h2>
    <div class="post-grid">
      <article class="post-card">
        <h2>Why I Built CogCore</h2>
        <p>Explain the problem, motivation, and gap CogCore is designed to fill.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="post-card">
        <h2>CogCore Architecture</h2>
        <p>Introduce the runtime model, core abstractions, and module boundaries.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="post-card">
        <h2>Tool Calling Design</h2>
        <p>Describe how CogCore models tools, execution, retries, and safety.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="post-card">
        <h2>Building Reliable AI Workflows</h2>
        <p>Turn engineering lessons from the repo into a practical technical post.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
